# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Remote Work & Hybrid Policy
**Document ID**: HR-011
**Classification**: Internal
**Effective Date**: January 1, 2025

---

## Policy Overview

MedSync Health embraces a hybrid work model that balances flexibility with collaboration. This policy outlines expectations for remote work, in-office requirements, and resources available to support distributed work.

---

## Work Models

### Hybrid (Default)

| Requirement | Details |
|-------------|---------|
| In-Office Days | 2-3 days per week |
| Core Office Days | Tuesday and Wednesday (required) |
| Flex Day | One additional day, team-determined |
| Remote Days | Remaining days |

**Applies to**: All roles unless designated Remote-First or On-Site

### Remote-First

| Requirement | Details |
|-------------|---------|
| In-Office | Quarterly team gatherings |
| Travel | Up to 4 trips/year to HQ or team locations |
| Time Zone | Must overlap 4+ hours with core team |

**Eligible Roles**:
- Individual contributors with 12+ months tenure
- Roles with no physical presence requirements
- Manager approval required
- VP approval for new hires

### On-Site Required

| Requirement | Details |
|-------------|---------|
| In-Office | 4-5 days per week |
| Remote Flexibility | One day per week with manager approval |

**Applies to**:
- Facilities & Workplace team
- IT Help Desk (some roles)
- Specific roles designated by department

