## Communication Expectations

### Response Times

| Channel | Expected Response |
|---------|------------------|
| Slack (urgent) | 30 minutes |
| Slack (normal) | 2 hours |
| Email | 24 hours |
| Meetings | Accept/decline within 24 hours |

### Video Call Standards
- Camera on for meetings <10 people (encouraged)
- Camera optional for large meetings
- Professional attire (business casual minimum)
- Mute when not speaking
- Be present (no multitasking)

### Availability Indicators
- Keep Slack status updated
- Block focus time on calendar
- Set working hours in Google Calendar
- Use "Away" messages when OOO

