## Manager Responsibilities

### For Hybrid Teams

- Coordinate in-office days for team alignment
- Ensure equitable meeting participation
- Regular 1:1s (in-person when possible)
- Team building across locations
- Monitor for burnout and isolation

### For Remote Employees

- Weekly video 1:1s
- Quarterly in-person meetups
- Clear goal-setting and feedback
- Inclusion in team communications
- Career development conversations

