## Performance Management

### Remote Performance Standards

| Metric | Expectation |
|--------|-------------|
| Output quality | Same as on-site |
| Responsiveness | Per communication guidelines |
| Collaboration | Active participation in team activities |
| Self-direction | Proactive communication |
