## Security Requirements

### All Remote Workers

| Requirement | Details |
|-------------|---------|
| VPN | Required for accessing internal systems |
| MFA | On all accounts |
| Screen lock | 5-minute timeout |
| Secure WiFi | WPA2/WPA3, no public networks |
| Company devices | Required for work |
| Encryption | Full disk encryption enabled |

### Prohibited Activities
- Using personal devices for work
- Accessing PHI from public locations
- Sharing credentials
- Disabling security software
- Working from unapproved countries

### Approved Countries for Remote Work
- United States
- United Kingdom
- Singapore
- Canada (temporary, <30 days)
- Other: Requires Security and Legal approval

