## FAQ

**Q: Can I work from a coffee shop?**
A: Yes, for non-PHI work. Ensure you use VPN and protect your screen from view.

**Q: What if I need to relocate temporarily for family reasons?**
A: Discuss with your manager. Temporary arrangements (<30 days) can usually be accommodated.

**Q: Can I permanently work remotely from a lower cost-of-living area?**
A: Remote-first roles allow this. Geographic compensation adjustments may apply.

**Q: What happens if my internet goes out?**
A: Notify your manager immediately. Use mobile hotspot as backup. Come to office if extended.

